OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGISRAELI CABINET DECIDES
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGARAB PEACE POLICY
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Israeli cabinet has decided to
OL,6, endorse the last government's May 1989
OL,7, initiative on Arab-Israeli peace.
OL,9,FThe initiative, already endorsed by
OL,10,FPrime Miniter Yitzhak Shamir, calls for
OL,11,Felections in the occupied territories
OL,12,Fof the West Bank and Gaza Strip.
OL,14,FThis will form the stance Israel will
OL,15,Fpresent to US Secretary of State James
OL,16,FBaker who arrives in Israel tomorrow.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FFour ministers were reported to have
OL,19,Fexpressed reservations over the plan
OL,20,Fwhich contributed to the downfall of
OL,21,Fthe last government.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG10-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
