OL,1,Vk4                               G7/8
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSCOTTISH CONFERENCE VOTES
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGAGAINST GULF WAR
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Labour Party conference in Scotland
OL,6, has approved a statement of opposition
OL,7, to the war against Iraq.
OL,9,FThe Scottish executive's statement
OL,10,Fregretted that military action was
OL,11,Ftaken before sanctions had been fully
OL,12,Fexhausted.
OL,14,FBut the statement also commended the
OL,15,Fliberation of Kuwait and condemned the
OL,16,FIraqi occupation.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FDuring the conference, defence
OL,19,Fspokesman Martin O'Neill warned there
OL,20,Fwould be huge job losses in the
OL,21,FScottish defence industry after the war
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG10-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
